Subject: [PATCH 09/13] ARM: dts: iwg23s-sbc: specify EtherAVB PHY IRQ
Date: Thu, 13 Sep 2018 11:08:32 +0200
Message-Id: <938fbd1ae2aca6e0547411687f0cc32d18427eae.1536824376.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
